/*  A method stores a text argument in a field.
    Obligation broken: O4, what a function stores into its parameters is its caller's business. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Define object box with (the text tag).
Bind void to retag unto box, given (the text t):
    one's tag becomes t.
Done.
Define keeper as a new box { the tag "outer" }.
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast keeper's retag on ("in" joined to "ner").
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State keeper's tag.
